    date: "2026-10-20",
    category: "02 Enterprise AI & Org Transformation · 08 AI Productivity Tools",
    title:
      "Across twenty-seven companies, AI spend per developer ranges from $150 to about $3,000 a month, and few can yet measure the return.",
    profile: "E2 T-Em U2 H-Ah Z-Now",
    strength: "weak",
    logic: {
      what: "Across twenty-seven companies, monthly AI spend per developer ranges from $150 to about $3,000, and few can measure return.",
      mechanism: "Spend is scaling faster than the ability to measure value, and subsidized pricing may be about to reprice the cost basis.",
      soWhat: "Define a value metric beyond pull-request counts before budgets reprice, or the ROI case will rest on weak proxies.",
    },
    sources: [
      {
        label: "newsletter.pragmaticengineer.com/p/whats-the-roi-of-software-engineers",
